sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant AgentLoop
    participant SkillLoader
    participant LLMClient
    participant ToolRegistry
    participant Tool

    User->>AgentLoop: task
    AgentLoop->>SkillLoader: select skills
    AgentLoop->>LLMClient: chat(history + system prompt)
    LLMClient-->>AgentLoop: thought/action JSON
    AgentLoop->>ToolRegistry: executeTool(name, args)
    ToolRegistry->>Tool: execute(args)
    Tool-->>AgentLoop: ToolResult
    AgentLoop-->>User: final answer
